      "w": 760,
      "text": "FLAUNT — user app (www.flaunt.network)\n\nOne story runs across screens 1–11: Arjun Mehta signs up, is granted 10 tokens, spends one inviting Nikhil Varma, and asks Priya Nair to introduce him to Riyad Rasheed.\n\nScreen 5 is the one that matters — 2nd-degree visibility with the email masked."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -186,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "BMS — internal admin (bms.flaunt.network)\n\nDeliberately a different visual language from the user app: cooler, denser, mono-heavy, sidebar-driven. It should never feel like the same product.\n\nRoot access is riyad@mobil80.com only; every other identity gets a 403."
    }
